# Docker build context exclusions (repository root context).
# Keep build contexts small and free of secrets. Per-package builds use the
# `.dockerignore` inside `frontend/` and `backend/` instead.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local state, secrets, and OpenSpec planning artifacts
docker/volumes
docker/database
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
openspec
.git
.github
.agents
.trae
.forge
.dsh
odoo rea
.claude

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.log
